    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/48bbc15e175dec6e223dee7f35c8f461.avif?t=1739594722\" width=768 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/2541bf7ce526be7cfbe81add9a134cea.webp?t=1739594722\" width=675 height=63 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/d8103a4b4dc01d02669e1e3c62642658.poster.avif?t=1739594722\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/d8103a4b4dc01d02669e1e3c62642658.webm?t=1739594722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/d8103a4b4dc01d02669e1e3c62642658.mp4?t=1739594722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve mastered the skies? Take on the new test of skill in the brand-new Canyon Run game mode! Navigate twisting, narrow paths and sudden forks as you race through the depths of a rugged canyon. Stay low to survive, and rely on split-second reactions to conquer the unpredictable turns. Do you have what it takes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just part of our continuing initiative to bring more free content and updates to Calm Skies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/acc6e6958b3cfb240ac5e99de5232412.avif?t=1739594722\" width=768 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill and tranquility of flying in Calm Skies. Perfect your wingsuit skills as you explore diverse biomes, dodge obstacles, and perform daring tricks to complete skill-testing challenges. Customize your character and enjoy a unique blend of excitement and serenity in the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/b7df837451da62b315b087d422428d24.webp?t=1739594722\" width=675 height=63 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/6d36920e2b6c1c5ea1778961bb262bea.poster.avif?t=1739594722\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/6d36920e2b6c1c5ea1778961bb262bea.webm?t=1739594722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/6d36920e2b6c1c5ea1778961bb262bea.mp4?t=1739594722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the rush of adrenaline as you glide close to the ground and obstacles, perfecting your flight skills to build an impressive high score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/01c4a9488bee7fda1642d861bbc0d09c.webp?t=1739594722\" width=675 height=63 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/f2ef3b3c159f9cf7c9c19f056f6d59d3.poster.avif?t=1739594722\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/f2ef3b3c159f9cf7c9c19f056f6d59d3.webm?t=1739594722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/f2ef3b3c159f9cf7c9c19f056f6d59d3.mp4?t=1739594722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes and agility as you maneuver around trees, hills, and narrow gaps on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/52b79756c529855e41a03ec59e6d01ca.webp?t=1739594722\" width=675 height=63 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/d998b7832d782410ffe74259b0fe3094.poster.avif?t=1739594722\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/d998b7832d782410ffe74259b0fe3094.webm?t=1739594722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/d998b7832d782410ffe74259b0fe3094.mp4?t=1739594722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and explore stunning landscapes and biomes, each offering unique challenges and beauty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/05ff4c325909148acadd579ec5778774.avif?t=1739594722\" width=768 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/dbc54aa9aee3c64ca8d93de468d038aa.webp?t=1739594722\" width=675 height=63 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/f357e7021fe739c7ffe268b65ae7b9e1.poster.avif?t=1739594722\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/f357e7021fe739c7ffe268b65ae7b9e1.webm?t=1739594722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/f357e7021fe739c7ffe268b65ae7b9e1.mp4?t=1739594722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your score by performing daring tricks and flying through rings scattered across the skies. Complete engaging challenges that push your flying abilities, and be rewarded with Wings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/6a73d72e116b4b1dd66696b5599e906d.webp?t=1739594722\" width=675 height=63 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/b771e6f31c72c4f69b02530131d3515b.poster.avif?t=1739594722\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/b771e6f31c72c4f69b02530131d3515b.webm?t=1739594722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/b771e6f31c72c4f69b02530131d3515b.mp4?t=1739594722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your wingsuit character with a variety of customization options to make your character truly your own. Unlock new customizations as you earn more Wings from challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive flight mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration in diverse biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Testing Challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheat Codes ;) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're seeking thrilling high-speed challenges or peaceful moments of aerial exploration, Calm Skies offers an unforgettable wingsuit flying experience. Take to the skies and find your calm amidst the clouds!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/48bbc15e175dec6e223dee7f35c8f461.avif?t=1739594722\" width=768 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/2541bf7ce526be7cfbe81add9a134cea.webp?t=1739594722\" width=675 height=63 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/d8103a4b4dc01d02669e1e3c62642658.poster.avif?t=1739594722\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/d8103a4b4dc01d02669e1e3c62642658.webm?t=1739594722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/d8103a4b4dc01d02669e1e3c62642658.mp4?t=1739594722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve mastered the skies? Take on the new test of skill in the brand-new Canyon Run game mode! Navigate twisting, narrow paths and sudden forks as you race through the depths of a rugged canyon. Stay low to survive, and rely on split-second reactions to conquer the unpredictable turns. Do you have what it takes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just part of our continuing initiative to bring more free content and updates to Calm Skies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/acc6e6958b3cfb240ac5e99de5232412.avif?t=1739594722\" width=768 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill and tranquility of flying in Calm Skies. Perfect your wingsuit skills as you explore diverse biomes, dodge obstacles, and perform daring tricks to complete skill-testing challenges. Customize your character and enjoy a unique blend of excitement and serenity in the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/b7df837451da62b315b087d422428d24.webp?t=1739594722\" width=675 height=63 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/6d36920e2b6c1c5ea1778961bb262bea.poster.avif?t=1739594722\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/6d36920e2b6c1c5ea1778961bb262bea.webm?t=1739594722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/6d36920e2b6c1c5ea1778961bb262bea.mp4?t=1739594722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the rush of adrenaline as you glide close to the ground and obstacles, perfecting your flight skills to build an impressive high score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/01c4a9488bee7fda1642d861bbc0d09c.webp?t=1739594722\" width=675 height=63 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/f2ef3b3c159f9cf7c9c19f056f6d59d3.poster.avif?t=1739594722\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s